@startuml F3.4-ERRO-b-guard-invalido
title F3.4-ERRO-b — Transição com guard inválido
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
participant "DeliberateRequestUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Deferir (UI stale)
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests/{id}/transitions\n{ action: DEFER }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  authority granular ausente
  ou guard workflow falhou
  → sem TX
end note
UC --> Ctrl: erro
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422 guard_failed
WebApp --> Prof: Problem Details

@enduml
